{
  "name": "Save the founders and finance leaders of newly funded companies as a list",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Save the founders and finance leaders of newly funded companies as a list\n\n### How it works\nFresh money means new budgets. Every hour the workflow reads your funding news feed and keeps items that mention a round. Your own AI model extracts the company name and website domain. Argorant previews the people with the titles in Settings at that domain, at most people_per_company each, and saves all of them in one list named after the date. A Slack message lists the companies and links the list, so your team can review it and add it to a campaign.\n\nCosts: previews and the list are free. Your chat model provider bills its own usage.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Paste your feed URL into **Funding news**.\n4. Pick a chat model in **Chat model** (any chat model node works).\n5. Set titles, people_per_company and max_companies in **Settings**, pick the channel in **Tell the team** and activate.\n\n### Customization\nAdd the list to a campaign automatically with Campaign > Add Leads.",
        "height": 609,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "40a32b81-cf52-44e6-8a45-150bf3666d29",
